FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: a-brief-recess.
OFF THE RECORD: a continuance is a timer that outlives the process.
OFF THE RECORD: Kill the interpreter during the recess and resume it
OFF THE RECORD: next week; the case still wakes on the original date,
OFF THE RECORD: because the date is on file and the official is not.
OFF THE RECORD: One court day is one second, by standing order.

ARTICLE 1.
    PROCLAIM "The court will take a brief recess.".
    ADJOURN FOR 1 DAY.
    PROCLAIM "The proceedings resume. For the Court, no time has passed.".
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
